msgid "Trying out Quarkus 3"
msgstr "Quarkus 3を試してみる"

msgid "As you might know by now, we started a Quarkus 3.0 effort last year and we are continuing this effort, which was described https://quarkus.io/blog/road-to-quarkus-3/[here], https://quarkus.io/blog/our-bumpy-road-to-jakarta-ee-10/[here], https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-0-alpha1-released/[here], and https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-0-alpha3-released/[here]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus 3.0.0.Alpha4 is the fourth iteration of this work and it marks a huge milestone:\n"
"the Jakarta EE 10 stream is now our default stream as the Jakarta EE 10 work has been integrated in the `main` branch of the Quarkus repository."
msgstr ""

msgid "On the Jakarta EE 10 front, it comes with minor upgrades all over the place to use the latest versions of the specs and implementations."
msgstr ""

msgid "But this version also comes with several new features and enhancements:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Azure Functions Extension"
msgstr ""

msgid "Add gRPC InProcess support"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support retrieval of all Multipart parts in RESTEasy Reactive"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support StatementInspector as `@PersistenceUnitExtension` managed bean"
msgstr ""

msgid "Introduce a way for users to customize Flyway configuration"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support custom Flyway credentials/URL"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bump kubernetes-client-bom from 6.3 to 6.4"
msgstr ""

msgid "Scheduler API - make it possible to schedule a job programmatically"
msgstr ""

msgid "Qute - Introduce CacheSectionHelper"
msgstr ""

msgid "Cache extension - Allow global default cache configuration"
msgstr ""

msgid "Flyway and Liquibase are now run as init containers in manifests."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Elasticsearch Java Client extension"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Finally, the migration script presented below has been vastly improved\n"
"and should be able to comprehensively migrate more projects."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We plan to release new Alphas regularly to share our progress in the next few months.\n"
"Until then, we encourage you to test it and report your feedback."
msgstr ""

msgid "For now the easiest way to get started is using https://code.quarkus.io/?S=io.quarkus.platform%3A3.0[code.quarkus.io] or use the Quarkus CLI:"
msgstr "今のところ、最も簡単な方法は、 https://code.quarkus.io/?S=io.quarkus.platform%3A3.0[code.quarkus.io] を使用するか、Quarkus CLIを使用することです："

msgid "Mind you that at this stage, while all the core extensions are available, only parts of the Quarkus platform is present. Not all extensions have yet migrated to Jakarta packages (e.g. Camel Quarkus or Kogito are not yet available)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Upgrading to Quarkus 3"
msgstr "Quarkus 3へのアップグレード"

msgid "For existing applications where all extensions are available, we have an OpenRewrite recipe that you can try."
msgstr "すべてのエクステンションが利用可能な既存のアプリケーションについては、OpenRewriteのレシピを用意していますので、お試しください。"

msgid "There is a one-liner that attempts to do it automatically using a JBang script."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you have JBang already installed, run:"
msgstr "JBangが既にインストールされている場合は、次を実行してください："

msgid "If not, for Linux and macOS:"
msgstr "そうでない場合は、LinuxとmacOSの場合は次を実行下さい："

msgid "and for Windows:"
msgstr "Windowsの場合は次を実行下さい："

msgid "Once this has been run your project should have its dependencies, source code and documentation updated to use Quarkus 3."
msgstr "これを実行すると、プロジェクトの依存関係、ソースコード、ドキュメントがQuarkus 3を使用するように更新されます。"

msgid "If it does not work for you, it could be we missed something or you are using extensions not yet supporting Quarkus 3."
msgstr "もしうまくいかない場合は、私たちが何か見落としているか、Quarkus 3をサポートしていないエクステンションを使用している可能性があります。"

msgid "Let us know in either case so we can together improve the migration script."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
